apel y dejarlo en contacto por al menos una hora o toda la noche si hace falta? Si nadie te lo ense\u00f1\u00f3, ahora ya sabes. No cen\u00e1s sabiendo, todo se aprende. Ponelo en pr\u00e1ctica y contame.", "history": [{"date": "2026-07-18", "plays": 919805, "likes": 28231, "comments": 191}, {"date": "2026-07-19", "plays": 923183, "likes": 28330, "comments": 191}, {"date": "2026-07-26", "plays": 1004464, "likes": 30917, "comments": 197}], "still_climbing": false, "hook_type": "Education", "is_relevant": true}, {"shortCode": "DaYjwqDPEXe", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DaYjwqDPEXe/", "caption": "Lo probaste? Lo probar\u00edas? Contame tu experiencia y compart\u00ed tus tips para combatir el fr\u00edo as\u00ed nos ayudamos entre todxs!! \u2744\ufe0f\ud83e\udd76\ud83e\ude75\n\n#casa #invierno #lifehcks #ventanas", "timestamp": "2026-07-04T20:07:32.000Z", "videoDuration": 50.83300018310547, "videoPlayCount": 3283249, "videoViewCount": 1530224, "likesCount": 156504, "commentsCount": 2077, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-man2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/731702809_18095574107630953_4740329929261778561_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ig_cache_key=MzkzNDA1MTU0OTgyMjMzODUyNjE4MDk1NTc0MTA0NjMwOTUz.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=0xOXj3kp9rwQ7kNvwGnrMi_&_nc_oc=Adq6h6uHRQL0tYtLX7IW9gDpKd5FsHsuq4Rvw8Q44YpEIUOFd0U6JJQ2zIeCa9QTxkA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-man2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=v9LTMcvvdaooyL_GEfC92w&_nc_ss=72a8c&oh=00_AQDV0AlyUf0I7tvP-ULs_zicyIDL1meW7mX4m85aCsQkUA&oe=6A6BE4BB", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-man2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNcFmw_8dWFiOBPSu95x9birvyrI5XJCm7xhjEiC2BZoGw_Z6V2wYe84kztLDFOHaDEQnQ7MInzWzsckdOjXmOn5wiLqssRgc6gGdg.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-man2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=hIgrUi46vVMQ7kNvwGVODjg&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV9